# Tells `wrangler deploy` (Workers Static Assets) what NOT to upload.
# .gitignore controls what git tracks; it has no effect on what wrangler
# publishes, since wrangler just walks the filesystem. Without this file,
# `npx wrangler deploy` with Output Directory "." uploads the entire repo,
# including .git/ — meaning the full commit history of this "private" repo
# becomes fetchable at https://platformops.srivantechnologies.com/.git/...
# That happened once already; this file is what stops it happening again.

.git
.git/**
.wrangler
.wrangler/**
node_modules
node_modules/**
